  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來行台語路"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">台文通訊30冬線頂讀者聯誼會</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span><div style=\"font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">2021/7/31 台灣時間 拜六暗時10:00-12:19，美東時間早起10:00-12:19<br /><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: bold;\">主持：陳豐惠</span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（李江却台語文教基金會執行長）</span></div><div style=\"font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">記錄：吳宛霖</div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tsit幾年有愈來愈濟20至40幾歲ê台灣青年，語文意識覺醒，透過學習讀寫，想beh kā家己ê族群語言khioh倒tńg--來，m̄-nā個人無愛koh做「母語ê文盲」，koh積極招厝內人做伙學，甚至tī各人ê領域用逐款方式推動台語iah是台文。Tsit條台語路，看--起-來簡單，實際上充滿鹹酸苦hiam。Lán做伙來聽in ê心聲。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">火星樂團guitarist、台語路樂團團長</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>楊晉淵：</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我是來自天龍國ê台語人，細漢時，阮老爸、老母有意識著若無hōo囡仔先學台語，後kái就無機會--ah。我為著囡仔教育報名台語讀寫班，koh有tī YouTube創「台語冷智識」頻道，用台語探討各種主題。尾--à hām囡仔參加台語路親子共學團，mā成立台語路樂團，逐家做伙創作。頭一張囡仔歌專輯按算2021年底開始募資，2022正式發行。未來拍算利用音樂專輯tsiūnn節目宣傳，突破仝溫層。&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">樂暢親子共學空間負責人</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>陳育萱:</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tshuā囡仔參加活動ê時，發現台語漸漸beh無--去--ah，所以我想beh uì家己做起，hām囡仔講台語，tsiah發現無台語繪本，所以邀請陳豐惠老師教阮台文，hōo爸爸媽媽tī親子共學空間ē-tàng tshuā囡仔做伙參加活動。希望lán ê台灣囡仔，ē-tàng繼續湠--落-去，tuì台語到台文。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">【沃草】網路媒體總編輯、《湯德章》尪仔冊台文版譯者</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>薛翰駿:</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">公視台語「台灣新眼界」當初想beh做台語版ê「有話好說」，我tī現場落台語標題，用詞學問有影深，佳哉有陳豐惠老師thang問。介紹逐家一本好冊《新編華台語對照典》，tsit本冊對我幫助真大。做《湯德章》尪仔冊台文翻譯，翻譯ê重點是，當時ê講法ài問序大，mā有請鄭順聰老師tàu-sann-kāng，出版無偌久就三刷，尾--à出版社tsiah敢出台文作品。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「牽囡仔ê手，行台語ê路」幹部</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>許雅茹:</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">是按怎行tsiūnn台語路? 一陣單純kap囡仔講母語ê爸母無細膩liâu--落-去。Kā囡仔揣伴，做伙講台語。利用共學ê時tsūn，大人做伙學台文，學習ê過程中，囡仔ná聽ná看，對囡仔是真好ê模範。透過文章、影片、分享會，siânn人來行台語路，為打造台語友善環境拍拚。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣師範大學台灣語文學系、靜宜大學台灣文學系兼任助理教授</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>石牧民:</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">對語言ê覺醒就是表達認同，lán拄著家己bē-hiáu ê語言、tī社會上無強勢ê語言，頭一个想--著ê代誌應該是去聽看māi、學看māi。我tsit-má tī大學教台語，beh hōo我ê學生有一个概念，想著台語ê時，是快樂ê記持、是開放ê記持。大部份戲劇一定有劇本，用台語寫劇本ê時tsūn，leh想按怎寫khah suí-khuì、hōo對話內容對聽ê眾人有意義，tse就是文學，án-ne就是沓沓仔發展台語文學。Kā台語囥tī戲劇，hōo社會愈來愈濟人講台語。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjQYcEyK1wlzlZyrR03g9AjGpWDERsji8_v5Zx3ZTgKA2z7iLBP_JmrmVVdKN-EYZ6YaskxO1lnpnBlZ3cZax8RGY0aJLUMKy2GIDLdG7EMVDVYVGz4dH_WQWs576txygb0zBxh2CZ3FyzB3fMT2hiRpzmY7eE3IICYUlk_fWmVPfoN9A1C-JVauX61RQ=s1424\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjQYcEyK1wlzlZyrR03g9AjGpWDERsji8_v5Zx3ZTgKA2z7iLBP_JmrmVVdKN-EYZ6YaskxO1lnpnBlZ3cZax8RGY0aJLUMKy2GIDLdG7EMVDVYVGz4dH_WQWs576txygb0zBxh2CZ3FyzB3fMT2hiRpzmY7eE3IICYUlk_fWmVPfoN9A1C-JVauX61RQ=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEijwz9siXL4UB9wm8Y_lK1Hwp_pj6VXv7Pwiwm_KSV35nQINaWpnGkjRkD-UicI2mPcfYf477u4Tk_1F1QWlDibRhAAWSgb2fmJYjmIicloZZAhZa2Nu1tdrJSzzGjG6x0aqGxx-lyrs0Xh5yGhbOW8dlowXntULcRzdQ7QJoi2ZHLI2gcYfakS-SAXGg=s3036\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEijwz9siXL4UB9wm8Y_lK1Hwp_pj6VXv7Pwiwm_KSV35nQINaWpnGkjRkD-UicI2mPcfYf477u4Tk_1F1QWlDibRhAAWSgb2fmJYjmIicloZZAhZa2Nu1tdrJSzzGjG6x0aqGxx-lyrs0Xh5yGhbOW8dlowXntULcRzdQ7QJoi2ZHLI2gcYfakS-SAXGg=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiO2pJJLiOsVC4LIguLVJwMdDkEwNXkezgA4dc9mA2jZReTUu37LCaYds8KH21hl8KHNNl3u_qJ2iPetvYwodobEaJKUKSKv0oCakSx8OyTLpNpGWa-SWDViXQU1WM2kYLuix15ZeC_5FAbX1WVInfbScmffY7rLdh8NhW4EFmhS1-PzNtM8Fpw_7v4yg=s3036\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiO2pJJLiOsVC4LIguLVJwMdDkEwNXkezgA4dc9mA2jZReTUu37LCaYds8KH21hl8KHNNl3u_qJ2iPetvYwodobEaJKUKSKv0oCakSx8OyTLpNpGWa-SWDViXQU1WM2kYLuix15ZeC_5FAbX1WVInfbScmffY7rLdh8NhW4EFmhS1-PzNtM8Fpw_7v4yg=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">#</b><b>台文通訊30歲</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報333期，2021年12月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div></div></div>"
